

#### 13.2.8 \(\Gamma(a)\,U(a,\,b,\,z)\)

\[=\epsilon^{As}\!\!\int_{A}^{\infty}e^{-it}(t\!-\!A)^{a-1}(t\!+\!B)^{b-a-1}\!dt\]

\[(A\!=\!1\!-\!B)\]

Similar integrals for \(M_{s,s}(z)\) and \(W_{s,s}(z)\) can be deduced with the help of 13.1.32 and 13.1.33.

##### Barnes-type Contour Integrals

\[\frac{\Gamma(a)}{\Gamma(b)}\,M(a,\,b,\,z)\!=\!\!\frac{1}{2\pi i}\!\int_{e-t_{a}}^ {e+i^{a}}\frac{\Gamma(-s)\Gamma(a\!+\!s)}{\Gamma(b\!+\!s)}\,(-z)^{\prime}ds\]

for \(|\mbox{arg }(-z)|\!<\!\!1\pi\), \(a,\,b\!\neq\!0\), \(-1\), \(-2\), .... The contour must separate the poles of \(\Gamma(-s)\) from those of \(\Gamma(a\!+\!s)\); \(c\) is finite.

\[\Gamma(a)\Gamma(1\!+\!a\!-\!b)z^{\prime}\!U(a,\,b,\,z)\] \[\qquad=\!\!\frac{1}{2\pi i}\!\int_{e-t_{a}}^{e+i^{a}}\Gamma(-s) \Gamma(a\!+\!s)\,\Gamma(1\!+\!a\!-\!b\!+\!s)z^{-\prime}ds\]

for \(|\mbox{arg }\varepsilon|\!<\!\!\frac{3\pi}{2}\), \(a\!\neq\!0\), \(-1\), \(-2\), \(\cdot\) \(\cdot\) \(\cdot\), \(b\!-\!a\!\neq\!1\), \(2\), \(3\), \(\cdot\) \(\cdot\) \(\cdot\) \(\cdot\) The contour must separate the poles of \(\Gamma(-s)\) from those of \(\Gamma(a\!+\!s)\) and \(\Gamma(1\!+\!a\!-\!b\!+\!s)\).

##### Connections With Bessel Functions (see chapters 9 and 10)

\[\begin{array}{l}\mbox{\bf Bessel Functions as Limiting Cases}\end{array}\]

If \(b\) and \(z\) are fixed,

\[\begin{array}{l}\mbox{\bf 13.3.1}\quad\lim_{a\!\to\infty}\{M(a,\,b,\,z/a)/\Gamma(b)\, \}\!=\!\!z^{4-b}I_{8-1}(2\sqrt{z})\end{array}\]

\[\begin{array}{l}\mbox{\bf 13.3.2}\quad\lim_{a\!\to\infty}\{M(a,\,b,\!-\!z/a)/\Gamma(b)\, \}\!=\!\!z^{4-b}J_{8-1}(2\sqrt{z})\end{array}\]

